        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yĩla wĩthĩ kũkita na amaitha maku, na Yeova Ngai waku aimanengane mokonĩ maku, naku ũimatwaa me atave, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kwona katĩ wa ala matavĩtwe mũndũ mũka mwanake, naku ũimwĩw’ĩa ĩtomo, na ũyenda kũmũtwaa ethĩwe mũka waku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nĩvo ĩndĩ mũtwae kwaku nyũmbanĩ yaku; nake nĩenze mũtwe wake, na kwela mbwaa syake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akaumye ngũa ya kũtavwa kwake, na kwĩkala nyũmbanĩ yaku, na kũmaĩĩa ĩthe na nyinyia mwei mũima: na ĩtina wa ũu lika kwake, wĩthĩwe mũũme wake, nake ethĩwe mũka waku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, ethĩwa ndũkwendeew’a nĩwe, mũnenge ũthei aende o vala ũnũkwenda; ĩndĩ ndũkamũthoosye mbesa, ndũkamwĩke ta ngombo, nũndũ nĩwamũthũkisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
