          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethĩwa mũndũ e na mwana mbaa matũ na mũng’endu, ũla ũtew’aa wasya wa ĩthe, kana wasya wa nyinyia, o na mamũkũna, ndamew’aa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nĩvo ĩthe wake na nyinyia mamũkwate, na kũmumĩlya kwa atumĩa ma ndũa yake, na mbingĩlonĩ ya vandũ vake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mamatavye atumĩa ma ndũa yake, Mwana ũũ waitũ nĩ mbaa matũ na mũng’endu, ndethukĩĩasya wasya witũ; nĩ mũyi na mũnywi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aũme onthe ma ndũa yake makamũkimange na mavia akw’e: ũu nĩw’o wĩvetaa ũthũku wume kwaku; na Isilaeli onthe makeew’a, na kũkĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
